# Implementation Plan - Add Payment and Slot Reservation Feature

This plan outlines the design and integration of a payment feature in the HealMind back-end application. When a patient books a doctor's slot and pays the deposit (via Stripe or Mock API), the reservation is completed and marked as confirmed, and the slot is reserved (isBooked = true) so it is no longer available to other patients.

## Proposed Changes

We will introduce a payment router and controller that supports both **Stripe Checkout Sessions** (with webhook updates) and a **Mock Payment Endpoint** (for easier client/frontend testing). We will also extend the Doctor's slots to track booking status and ensure that only non-booked slots can be reserved.

