#### [MODIFY] [session.controller.js](file:///d:/Capistone_sama/graduation-project-healmind/Back_End/controllers/session.controller.js)
- Update `updateSessionStatus` to release slots when a session is cancelled:
  - If a session status becomes `cancelled` (or `rejected`), and it has a `slotId`, find the associated doctor and update the slot's `isBooked` status to `false`.

#### [NEW] [doctor.routs.js / doctor.controller.js additions]
- Add a route: `GET /api/doctor/:id/available-slots` (Protected, accessible to Patients)
  - Returns only the slots for a doctor where `isBooked` is false (or not true). This is essential so patients can select an active slot.

